<p class="games-lead">Little games played in the page, each one a tag of its own - a file of
<code>pad/subs/games/types/</code> in the engine, written <code>{open/}game 'name'/{close/}</code>, as
<code>{open/}game:name/{close/}</code> or, when nothing else has the name, bare. The server writes
the board, a script in the page plays it.</p>

<ul class="games-cards">
  {games}
  <li><a class="games-card" href="?{$game}"><b>{$name}</b><span>{$line}</span><code>{open/}{$game}/{close/}</code></a></li>
  {/games}
</ul>
